1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
Your 20s are not

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:02,940
a playground to waste.

3
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:03,600
They are the concrete

4
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,080
foundation of your entire

5
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,560
future.

6
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:07,380
Every late night you

7
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,920
spend building skills,

8
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,160
every sacrifice you make

9
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,660
while others are partying,

10
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,700
and every hard lesson

11
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,240
you swallow is compounding

12
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:16,260
interest for your 30s.

13
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,340
Stop treating your youth

14
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,840
like a rehearsal.

15
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:19,520
The habits you build

16
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,340
today,

17
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,520
the circle you keep,

18
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:22,340
and the discipline you

19
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,860
master right now will

20
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,020
dictate whether you conquer

21
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,280
your dreams or watch

22
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,340
someone else live them.

23
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,800
Build fiercely.
